# --- generated; rebuilt by the pipeline --------------------------------------
# The analysis database is ~110 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB limit, and is rebuilt
# from source by `python pipeline/build.py`.
data/analyst.db
data/analyst.db-journal

# Statistics Canada downloads (~1.4 GB). Every one is re-fetched from its
# published URL by `python pipeline/fetch.py`; sources.py lists them all.
data/raw/

# Build logs.
data/_*.log

# The single-file Artifact build.
build/

# NOTE: data/legacy_residence_series.csv is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds
# the 2001, 2006 and 2011 census legs, whose original bulk files are no longer
# on disk and are not on the Web Data Service. It is the durable record, and a
# rebuild cannot recreate it.

# NOTE: docs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the GitHub Pages site,
# generated from app/ by `python pipeline/make_deploy.py`. Edit app/, never docs/.

# --- tooling -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.claude/
